==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|VL.|fr}} *''mentionica'', from {{etyl|LL.|fr}} {{term|mentio|lang=la}}, ''mentionis'' (in the sense of "lie" rather than "mention"), probably formed from haplology of a root *''mentītiō'', from {{term|mentitus|mentītus|lang=la}}, past participle of {{term|mentior|lang=la}}. Cf. also Italian {{term|menzogna|lang=la}} and Old French {{term|mensoigne|lang=fro}}, from a different root and Romanian {{term|minciună|lang=ro}}.

